  m_text: 'Game Rules:

    1. Press green button to start launching targets.

    2.
    Shoot targets to score points.

    3. Once you have no more targets to shoot,
    teleport to the next station by shooting the tree titled "Next Station".

    3.
    Your goal is to reach 10 points. Missing too many targets will result in failure
    (note amount of pots left!)'
